:''Not to be confused with [[Dark Emperor Santa]].''
'''Satan Claus''' (サタンクロース ''Satan Kurōsu'', '''Satan Claus''') is an [[:Category:Alien Enemies|Alien]] variant of [[Dark Emperor Santa]] introduced in [[Christmas in Space (Monthly Event)|Christmas in Space]]. He was added in [[Version 7.5 Update|Version 7.5]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Satan Claus
|image = E 430.png
|appearance = [[Christmas in Space (Monthly Event)|Christmas in Space]]<br>
[[December Gauntlet II]]<br>
[[Infernal Tower/Floor 17|Infernal Tower - Floor 17]]
|money drop = 1500¢ - 5925¢
}}

==Enemy==
He is much faster than Dark Emperor Santa in both attacks and movement speed. He also [[Warp|warps]] Cat Units with every attack, which makes him quite a serious opponent. However, his range is much shorter. Unfortunately for him, the warp is usually less concerning than Dark Emperor Santa's [[Freeze|freeze]], due to Satan Claus's shorter range.

==Strategy==
[[Rover Cat (Rare Cat)|Rover Cat]] is perfect for protecting your attackers and [[:Category:Crowd-Controller-class Cats|crowd-controllers]] against Satan Claus, being spammable and immune to warp. Other [[:Category:Cats with Warp Immunity|Warp-Blockers]] can also help in keeping Satan Claus from advancing.

Because of his fast attack rate and guaranteed warp, it's hard to get [[:Category:Rusher-class Cats|Rushers]] or [[:Category:Tanker-class Cats|Tankers]] in to kill Satan Claus without good timing or something to freeze him. However, you can time an [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut]] with ease.

