*Satan Claus had no official English name until [[December Gauntlet II]] was introduced, 3 years after his debut.
*Satan Claus, [[Gorilliam]], [[Bears Be Back]] and [[Commander Ostromeda]] are the only [[:Category:Unstarred Alien Enemies|unstarred Aliens]] with the Warp ability.
**Commander Ostromeda is the only one to have a description and the only one who was not introduced in a Lucky Ticket G event.

